   "widgets_values": [
    "## 7 \u00b7 The trailer score\nLTX 2.5 renders one long, small shot from the film's dark title card (`oc_title_card.jpg`): with nothing moving in frame, its audio comes out as music. The studio keeps only the sound and cuts the trailer's cards and shots on its hits."
