   "title": "CLIP Text Encode (Prompt)",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "A movie title card for \"Glass Eye\" glows on a dark background; the camera slowly pushes in. Audio: a hopeful, swelling trailer score with warm strings, piano and a rising choir. A movie trailer soundtrack: it opens with a single deep boom, then a steady rhythm of percussion hits about once per second, building in intensity with instrumentation suited to the score, punctuated by cinematic impacts, ending on one final hit followed by silence. Studio-recorded instrumental music only: no ambience, no weather, no voices."
   ]
  },
